{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sacred Earth - Reverie",
    "steam_appid": 2937520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/202d68f8255d89d02d83556c18a6b81f.avif?t=1749085769\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/aa32cd38d90827164b8e201773bac6f5.avif?t=1749085769\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred Earth - Reverie is a fantasy RPG with visual novel elements, inspired by both classic and modern JRPGs. Follow the story of a former knight of the kingdom as they go on a personal journey through the countryside in order to uncover hidden truths and long lost mysteries of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, interact with your allies and the townsfolk, build your characters with equipment, abilities, and perks, and test your might against foes in fast-paced turn-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/1f5106e28407dd55a5606e483f0c6ff4.avif?t=1749085769\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Choose Your Protagonist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a2510e2f9f54517f3ec97afa80bd813e.avif?t=1749085769\" width=457 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Cain or Abelle to be the protagonist of your journey. They have differing personalities as well as differing dialogue at points. But their stories are the same, so choose who you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dungeon Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize point and click functions to explore dungeons and study the environment. Seek treasures and interact with your allies to learn more about each other and your surroundings as you advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Town Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of townspeople await in the Town of Istina. Learn about their daily lives, as well as those of your allies, as you pass the times together. Gear up for your next dungeon, take quests, and wind down with amusing conversations and side events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced turn-based battles against dangerous enemies utilizing various resources. Each character has a unique skill set with special interactions and conditional effects. Learn what each of your allies can do, Chain together Arts for big damage, and manage your resources in order to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Multiple Endings and Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/6e8af7a11f14ab33c548c5202b8e0cb7.avif?t=1749085769\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will decide the fate of these characters. Experience multiple endings depending on how you approach exploration and the story. Keep your eyes peeled for hidden events and interactions. They just may change the course of the story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/202d68f8255d89d02d83556c18a6b81f.avif?t=1749085769\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/aa32cd38d90827164b8e201773bac6f5.avif?t=1749085769\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacred Earth - Reverie is a fantasy RPG with visual novel elements, inspired by both classic and modern JRPGs. Follow the story of a former knight of the kingdom as they go on a personal journey through the countryside in order to uncover hidden truths and long lost mysteries of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dungeons, interact with your allies and the townsfolk, build your characters with equipment, abilities, and perks, and test your might against foes in fast-paced turn-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/1f5106e28407dd55a5606e483f0c6ff4.avif?t=1749085769\" width=550 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Choose Your Protagonist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a2510e2f9f54517f3ec97afa80bd813e.avif?t=1749085769\" width=457 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Cain or Abelle to be the protagonist of your journey. They have differing personalities as well as differing dialogue at points. But their stories are the same, so choose who you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Dungeon Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/a960a30dfe2a782834f5c514c64058ec.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize point and click functions to explore dungeons and study the environment. Seek treasures and interact with your allies to learn more about each other and your surroundings as you advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Town Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/60dd0fa97497d7d3ef2b16b49d638228.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of townspeople await in the Town of Istina. Learn about their daily lives, as well as those of your allies, as you pass the times together. Gear up for your next dungeon, take quests, and wind down with amusing conversations and side events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.poster.avif?t=1749085769\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.webm?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/46167a59ef3f6d977c526e15480156d8.mp4?t=1749085769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced turn-based battles against dangerous enemies utilizing various resources. Each character has a unique skill set with special interactions and conditional effects. Learn what each of your allies can do, Chain together Arts for big damage, and manage your resources in order to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Multiple Endings and Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937520/extras/6e8af7a11f14ab33c548c5202b8e0cb7.avif?t=1749085769\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions will decide the fate of these characters. Experience multiple endings depending on how you approach exploration and the story. Keep your eyes peeled for hidden events and interactions. They just may change the course of the story.</p>",
